  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated response to address protection needs of older women and men, persons living with disabilities and other People with specific needs in three IDPs zones, in three refugees camps and surrounding host communities of Benishangul Gumuz Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved protection and inclusion for at-risk older men &amp; women, PwDs and other PSNs living in IDPs, refugees and host communities in Benishangul Gumuz Region</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased access to and use of health and nutrition services appropriate for Older people, PwDs and other PSNs</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute towards the protection of internally displaced persons (IDPs), refugees and host communities through community based and direct support mechanisms as well as enhanced awareness on specific life thretening protection risks of people at risk including people with disabilities, older people and other PSNs;</narrative>
  </description>
